%% A-0028 single-trial probe pipeline (package draft, Agent V)
%% Basis of paper Figure F1 (roadmap.md Section 27).
sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Stimulus generator
  participant M as Subject model (memory tracker)
  participant S as Scorer

  Note over G: build trial for grid cell (d, g, s)
  G->>M: frame 0 + positive point prompt on target
  Note over M: memory bank initialized (the "click")
  loop prefix frames (smooth motion)
    G->>M: frame t
    M->>M: memory update (appearance + location)
  end
  Note over G,M: temporal gap g - frames WITHHELD,<br/>world keeps moving, memory goes stale
  G->>M: MANIPULATION frame<br/>(swap / jump / appearance_flip / placebo)
  M->>S: predicted mask at manipulation frame
  S->>S: IoU vs target-at-new-location (A)<br/>IoU vs old-location occupant (B)
  Note over S: trichotomy:<br/>follow-object (A>=0.5, B<0.1)<br/>follow-place (B>=0.5, A<0.1)<br/>lost (near-empty) / other
  loop post frames (persistence window)
    G->>M: frame t
    M->>S: mask -> persistence / recovery
  end
  S->>S: aggregate cell: Wilson CIs ->  psychometric fit -> location-prior index
